<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσσ-ῡμα</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάττ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, τό</span> (cf. sq.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything stitched of leather</i>,
			esp. <i>sole of a shoe</i> or <i>sandal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				301
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				315
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				869
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				29.4
			</span></i>; of cork soles, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				2.30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδήσασθαι ἐχθρῶν παρ᾽ ἀνδρῶν
				καττύματα</span> to put on <i>shoes</i> made by an enemy,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1160
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., in
			pl., <i>patchings, botchings</i>, of bad music, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1138b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
